A '''Repeater''' is a {{Common}} [[Vanilla Objects/Redstone-Related Blocks|Redstone-related]] block that can be used on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |A2 = Redstone Torch |B2 = Redstone Dust |C2 = Redstone Torch
 |A3 = Stone          |B3 = Stone         |C3 = Stone
 |Output = Repeater
}}
}}

=== Shop Purchase ===
A '''Repeater''' can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Mad Redstone Engineer}} for {{Coins|6}}.

== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Repeaters''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. Its [[mcw:Redstone Repeater#Usage|functionality]] only work on the {{Zone|Private Island}}, but there are [[Private Island#Redstone Restrictions|restrictions]] on how often it can be used. Redstone is disabled on {{Zone|The Garden}}.

